1	/* Every color, radius, and type metric below resolves through a custom
2	   property that tokens.ts writes from resources/jusprin/ui/design-tokens.json:
3	   --<group>-<name> for colors, --radius-<name> for radii, --font-<role> for
4	   the `font` shorthand of each type role and --font-code for code. Padding,
5	   margin, and gap stay literal but must sit on the spacing scale. styles.test.ts
6	   fails the build on any literal outside those rules. */
7	
8	/* The product font ships with OrcaSlicer, but it is registered as a private
9	   font of the native process and WKWebView renders in a separate process
10	   that cannot see it. A Latin subset is embedded so the Agent page uses the
11	   same face as the native shell; CJK text falls through to the system font. */
12	@font-face {
13	  font-family: 'HarmonyOS Sans SC';
